{"material_id": "ntce.youer.zonghe.2011b.q32.material.recovered", "text": "湖北省仙桃市刘家集镇中学学生徐光明，今年 15 岁，平时不善言谈，孤独冷漠不喜欢集体生活，不爱参加课外活动、不喜欢上体育课，常独来独往，不会关心别人，不善于与他人相处，学习成绩全班倒数第一。一次在学校元旦聚餐会上，他把自己爱吃的里脊肉、大鸡腿、排骨、草莓、苹果一股脑儿放在自己的碗中独自享用，全然不顾周围同学们的反应。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "429f787e838c3a677d8edba8987759d1ed196cb834d8ad490c0532932eb904c9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4317, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4477, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "429f787e838c3a677d8edba8987759d1ed196cb834d8ad490c0532932eb904c9"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2011b.q32"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.m1.k1"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.ethics"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.101.r001", "ntce.outline.101.r002", "ntce.outline.101.r004"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2011b.q32"], "word_count": 159, "level": "youer", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "429f787e838c3a677d8edba8987759d1ed196cb834d8ad490c0532932eb904c9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4317, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4477, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "429f787e838c3a677d8edba8987759d1ed196cb834d8ad490c0532932eb904c9"}], "type": "