{"material_id": "ntce.youer.zonghe.2011b.q33.material.recovered", "text": "某中学校一位实习老师，教数学。他上课很有趣，但对学生很严格，如果有同学上黑板演示题目做不出题，就会骂人。最严重的一次是，一个学习不好的男同学被教了好几次还做不对，他一怒之下就把人家的头往黑板上撞，用非常粗俗的话骂他。那个男生受不了这样的刺激，最后厌学，不肯再读书了，连高中都没上。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "429f787e838c3a677d8edba8987759d1ed196cb834d8ad490c0532932eb904c9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4501, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4642, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 33, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "429f787e838c3a677d8edba8987759d1ed196cb834d8ad490c0532932eb904c9"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2011b.q33"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.m1.k3", "ntce.youer.zonghe.m2.k01", "ntce.youer.zonghe.m3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.ethics"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.101.r007", "ntce.outline.101.r008", "ntce.outline.101.r010", "ntce.outline.101.r011", "ntce.outline.101.r013", "ntce.outline.101.r014", "ntce.outline.101.r018", "ntce.outline.101.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2011b.q33"], "word_count": 140, "level": "youer", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "429f787e838c3a677d8edba8987759d1ed196cb834d8ad490c0532932eb904c9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4501, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4642, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "quest